["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is the Iran War good for the planet? Strait of Hormuz Strategic Petroleum Reserve petrostates vs electrostates permitting reform\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-20-grayarea-伊朗战争切断霍尔木兹两成石油-油价却没涨到200美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ebbc73f24465a9d8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>伊朗战争切断霍尔木兹两成石油，油价却没涨到200美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这场史上最大石油供应中断本该把油价推到200美元，结果靠中国囤货、沙特绕道管线和各国战略储备硬扛了过去，而真正伤到全球经济的是柴油，不是汽油。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源政策</span><span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How an American AI Company Uses Chinese Open-Weight Models open weight obliterated model RL environment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-20-oddlots-美国ai创业公司私下都在用中国开源模型-只是不敢公开说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">48:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>美国AI创业公司私下都在用中国开源模型，只是不敢公开说</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的护城河不是选哪个基础模型，而是能不能用自己的数据把开源权重微调成比巨头单次调用更便宜、更准的专用模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">模型微调</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vasa: History&#x27;s Least Successful Warship broadside psychological safety\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-20-cautionary-瓦萨号沉没真相-不是国王瞎指挥-是没人敢说真话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">36:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>瓦萨号沉没真相：不是国王瞎指挥，是没人敢说真话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">瓦萨号首航十分钟内倾覆，流传百年的「国王瞎改设计」说法是神话，真正致命的是副将弗莱明明知船不安全，却因为怕得罪国王而对这个致命问题保持沉默。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理安全感</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Joe Studwell on How Africa Works, and What It Tells Us About China developmental state performance legitimacy AGOA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-20-sinicapodcast-人口密度-不是腐败或民族冲突-才是非洲发展的天花板/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bca247db164ef0a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Sinica Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>人口密度，不是腐败或民族冲突，才是非洲发展的天花板</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者放弃了腐败、民族冲突这类主流解释，论证说非洲独立时人口密度不到每平方公里十人，这才是城市化、财政和基建长期起不来的根源，东亚模式的政策本身反而是通用的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">非洲发展</span><span class=\"tag\">东亚模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Scaling Linear’s GTM to $100M ARR — Cristina Cordova, COO MCP SDR AE Forward Deployed Engineer Loops\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-latentspace-linear-coo自曝-企业级销售靠砍掉原定路线图-全力押注agent才追上来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4bdc663aa3f33e23-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>Linear COO自曝：企业级销售靠砍掉原定路线图，全力押注agent才追上来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Linear在2025年临时放弃原定的企业级功能路线图，转去全力建MCP服务器和agent平台，结果反而靠这个赢得了原计划拿不到的大客户。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">GTM</span><span class=\"tag\">企业销售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Should TSMC Make 3D DRAM? High-Aspect Ratio etching oxide semiconductor（IGZO等） Back End of the Line / Front End of the Line gain cell FeFET\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-asianometry-tsmc-真要造-3d-dram-nvidia-开口-历史包袱还在/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/71aac68272b8f78a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">17:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>TSMC 真要造 3D DRAM？Nvidia 开口，历史包袱还在</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TSMC 曾两次尝试为客户代工 DRAM 都以失败收场，如今 Nvidia 的请求让它重新面对这个二十年没碰过的生意，但这次说的不是传统 DRAM，而是基于氧化物半导体的全新堆叠存储。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半导体</span><span class=\"tag\">TSMC</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The making of Anthropic public benefit corporation Glasswing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-anthropic-anthropic-曾落后到不行-三年前客户问凭什么选你们/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1133dbc5dfc7944-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">15:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Anthropic</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic 曾落后到不行：三年前客户问凭什么选你们</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic 创立后一度完全落后于前沿模型，靠死磕预训练和RL熬过「受苦的几年」才追上来，而这段差距期反而让安全研究更扎实。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span><span class=\"tag\">公司历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Julian Gewirtz on the AI risks that actually scare Beijing loss of control anquan AGI-pilled Mythos\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-eightythousand-北京最怕的ai风险不是ai失控-而是政权失去控制/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c851b271273144ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>北京最怕的AI风险不是AI失控，而是政权失去控制</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国官方说的「失控」首先指政治控制的丧失，而非对齐失控；比起AI安全论文，美国展现出的网络攻击能力(Mythos事件)才是过去一年里真正让北京紧张起来的事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美关系</span><span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Fast Should We Build Superintelligence? | Nick Bostrom pacing the frontier situationally aware Gini coefficient\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-a16z-延迟一天都不该多等-博斯特罗姆算了超级智能的最优时点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">39:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>延迟一天都不该多等：博斯特罗姆算了超级智能的最优时点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">博斯特罗姆用人命换算延迟成本：每天约15万人死于自然原因，所以除非安全研究能让风险快速下降，否则最优延迟只是几个月到几年，而不是几十年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">超级智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Abhinav Ghosh on the role of NGO workers in Education Policy and Delivery in India FLN (Foundational Literacy and Numeracy) MOU implicit bureaucrats\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-ideasofindia-印度ngo员工坐在政府办公室里-靠-上面的命令-指挥官员却无正式身份/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/79bdc8c7009c7460-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ideas of India</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>印度NGO员工坐在政府办公室里，靠「上面的命令」指挥官员却无正式身份</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这些NGO基层员工不是公务员，却能借政府文件上的logo、共用的办公桌座位等暗示性符号获得官员服从；面对教师时，同一人立刻换成说服而非命令的姿态。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育政策</span><span class=\"tag\">NGO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Superintelligence Needs the Physical World with CEO and Co-Founder of Arda Bob McGrew hard takeoff forward deployed engineering (FDE) Von Neumann probe Drake equation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-nopriors-超级智能困在数据中心里-离开它才算真的开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/37c17736c18ba5a1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">59:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>超级智能困在数据中心里，离开它才算真的开始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Arda创始人Bob McGrew认为自动化研究员只是一次性加速而非递归自我改进，真正的瓶颈是物理世界：实验要在湿实验室跑，机器人要在工厂装配，智能必须走出数据中心才能变成生产力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">制造业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Does Every Canadian Need a Financial Planner? | #436 credence good Dunning-Kruger curve fee-only / advice-only\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-rationalreminder-只有5-加拿大人找理财规划师-44-不懂规划到底是什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>只有5%加拿大人找理财规划师，44%不懂规划到底是什么</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大多数人把买基金等同于理财规划，但退休提取、遗产安排、税务协调才是规划的大头，却是普及率最低的部分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span><span class=\"tag\">行业结构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Hard Is It to Get Off Antidepressants? SSRI SNRI brain zaps tapering\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-sciencevs-停抗抑郁药的真实风险-吃了两年以上-戒断率可能超四分之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d090f82d7f4dd2d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">47:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>停抗抑郁药的真实风险：吃了两年以上，戒断率可能超四分之一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">官方指南和大型临床试验说停药只有3%的人会有严重症状，但那些试验只测了吃药八到十二周的人；一项针对长期服用者的调查发现，吃药两年以上者有四分之一报告了严重戒断症状。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">抗抑郁药</span><span class=\"tag\">精神健康</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"This Is The Problem With AI&#x27;s Most Bullish Chart ground truth tight gradient descent LTV (Loan-to-Value) TAM fractional reserve banking\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-oddlots-gpu租金指数一路走高-这可能是缺钱的信号-不是缺芯片的信号/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>GPU租金指数一路走高：这可能是缺钱的信号，不是缺芯片的信号</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GPU出租价格上涨常被当作AI需求旺盛的铁证，但这期揭示它更可能反映的是中小云厂商借不到低息贷款、被迫靠更高客户预付款硬撑的融资紧张。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">GPU融资</span><span class=\"tag\">信贷市场</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Edward Said and the question of Palestine Orientalism Oslo Accord West-Eastern Divan Orchestra\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-throughline-萨义德把巴勒斯坦问题带进美国主流话语-却从未等到他期望的和解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4024x4024+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F02%2F04%2F30b53e8145b4a73e61d296056ad9%2F1c50c67c-46c2-421d-91f3-a194d2396347.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>萨义德把巴勒斯坦问题带进美国主流话语，却从未等到他期望的和解</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">萨义德一生试图用文学与音乐的语言让西方理解巴勒斯坦人的存在，但他晚年亲眼看到奥斯陆协议签署后杀戮反而更多，并断定两国方案已被现实架空。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">巴以冲突</span><span class=\"tag\">后殖民理论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Juba II: Rome’s King of Africa client king Euphorbia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-ancients-凯撒把战败敌人的幼子养大-养成了北非最亲罗马的国王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/118420a97bcb462e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>凯撒把战败敌人的幼子养大，养成了北非最亲罗马的国王</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱巴二世两岁时作为战俘被凯撒牵着游街，却被收养进屋大维娅家中长大，最终被奥古斯都扶上毛里塔尼亚王位，统治四十年从未被罗马怀疑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马帝国</span><span class=\"tag\">北非历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Hatshepsut: Was This Really Egypt&#x27;s Greatest Pharaoh? regent Opet Festival co-regency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-historyhit-哈特谢普苏特不是女扮男装-她把自己做成了法老/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6426b5c63fd6a864-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>哈特谢普苏特不是女扮男装，她把自己做成了法老</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她不是伪装成男人的女王，而是把王权本身的图像语言——那副假胡须——改写成「国王」的标志，用贸易和建筑而非战争定义了何为伟大的统治者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古埃及</span><span class=\"tag\">法老</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"724. The Charge of the Light Brigade: Into The Valley of Death (Part 4) redoubt the thin red line Causeway Heights\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-restishistory-轻骑兵冲锋并非愚蠢送死-战术上它其实成功了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77709224d0619622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>轻骑兵冲锋并非愚蠢送死：战术上它其实成功了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">命令含糊、将领失和导致六百轻骑兵冲向三面炮火的死亡谷，但他们真的打垮了俄军炮兵和骑兵，是战略上的灾难，战术上的胜利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亚战争</span><span class=\"tag\">军事史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"415. Lawrence of Arabia: Rory Stewart vs. William Dalrymple - The Legacy (Part 5) Seven Pillars of Wisdom Sykes-Picot McMahon letters India Office Arab Bulletin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-empirehist-劳伦斯写信痛斥英国在伊拉克撒谎-结果被昔日同僚联手抹黑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">49:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>劳伦斯写信痛斥英国在伊拉克撒谎，结果被昔日同僚联手抹黑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他对伊拉克占领的愤怒预言了百年后的战争现实，但正是这些批评招来印度事务处和外交部的全力抹黑，说他不懂阿拉伯语、没资格说话。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东史</span><span class=\"tag\">殖民主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"189: Geodesic顾全全：预训练有点“无聊”了，但用scaling改变AI制药才刚开始 训飞 Try2 Scaling Law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-19-latetalk-预训练的新意正在变少-但把scaling搬进ai制药才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac7d832522d328e5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>预训练的新意正在变少，但把Scaling搬进AI制药才刚开始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字节的蛋白质结构设计模型只用2650万个结构数据就训出900兆参数模型，而公开结构数据有13亿个——算力而不是数据，才是AI制药现在最大的瓶颈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI制药</span><span class=\"tag\">Scaling</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Side Project to $9M Raised, No Co-Founder | Yahia Bakour, Context.dev NRR (Net Revenue Retention) design partner agency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-solofounders-融到900万美元后他说-拿了风投的钱-更应该一个人创业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba8972d929c3a758-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">57:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>融到900万美元后他说：拿了风投的钱，更应该一个人创业</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把融资比作婚姻：一旦签了就是十年，而正因为用的是别人的钱，独自决策反而让该转向、该拒绝的艰难时刻更容易拍板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">独立创始人</span><span class=\"tag\">融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What Does It All Mean, Though? trial by combat weregild\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-britishhist-罗兰之歌-审判戏其实是给封建公爵们的一记警告/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>《罗兰之歌》审判戏其实是给封建公爵们的一记警告</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加纳隆被马拉肢解、全家三十名男丁被灭门，这个结局是在为「国王拥有绝对暴力垄断权」的集权叙事背书，而非单纯的复仇故事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪史</span><span class=\"tag\">封建制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Shopping in an Era of Surveillance Capitalism surveillance pricing drip pricing dark patterns loyalty penalty right to repair\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-mastersinbiz-忠诚计划的陷阱-你越常买-优惠反而越少/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cce6bb022eede7c0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>忠诚计划的陷阱：你越常买，优惠反而越少</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一旦算法确认你是「稳定客户」，公司不再需要给你折扣，星巴克和麦当劳的用户数据报告都证明了这一点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">监控定价</span><span class=\"tag\">消费者权益</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Notion’s Founder on the One Thing Your AI Is Missing vibe coding headless product\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-aiandi-notion创始人-ai能给你代码-但不该替你保管-理解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9bccab920fb419de-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">33:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>Notion创始人：AI能给你代码，但不该替你保管「理解」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vibe coding让人人都能做软件，但Ivan Zhao认为真正耐久的不是UI和过程代码，而是数据和上下文——谁掌握这个，谁才是AI时代的赢家。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Notion</span><span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span>\n</div></div></a>"]